{"pull": {"id": "number:22047", "number": 22047, "title": "KAFKA-20442: Update streams group assignment epoch when last member leaves", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-04-14T08:56:38Z", "closed_at": "2026-04-15T07:40:32Z", "merged_at": "2026-04-15T07:40:32Z", "user": {"login": "dajac", "id": 157182, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzE4Mg==", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157182?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac", "html_url": "https://github.com/dajac", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dajac/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "When the last member of a streams group is fenced, the group epoch is\nbumped but the assignment epoch is not updated. This leaves the empty\ngroup with `groupEpoch > assignmentEpoch`, violating the invariant that\nan empty group should have matching epochs. This patch writes a\n`StreamsGroupTargetAssignmentMetadataRecord` when the fence operation\nresults in an empty group so that the assignment epoch catches up to the\ngroup epoch.\n\nReviewers: Lucas Brutschy <lbrutschy@confluent.io>, Sean Quah <squah@confluent.io>, Ken Huang <s7133700@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 8846059803, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAACD0QpGw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/group-coordinator", "name": "group-coordinator", "color": "9AFD22", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/22047"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/Cherry-pick_is_pr.json"}